title: Find a doctor
description: GPs in Australia with experience in ME/CFS, Long COVID and low-dose naltrexone (LDN), from a list shared by Griffith University's NCNED, plus how to find others.
hideReadTime: true
brief:
  - These GPs were recommended by **Griffith University's NCNED** research team, mostly in **south-east Queensland and northern NSW**.
  - Some are marked as **LDN prescribers** or as **seeing ME/CFS and Long COVID patients**.
